# Local Expo state: device history, dev-server settings and the generated
# typed-route declarations (.expo/types/router.d.ts). Machine-specific.
#
# The root .gitignore already lists `apps/mobile/.expo/`, but `expo-doctor`
# reads only the project's own .gitignore and reports the directory as
# uncommitted-but-tracked without this file — a check that fails the moment
# anyone runs `expo start` here. Duplicated deliberately, not by oversight.
.expo/

# `expo export` output.
dist/
